---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Author & Editorial Standards - KoreanNames.info"
  description="Learn about our editorial process, native Korean linguistic research team, and cultural accuracy standards."
>
  <div class="container page-wrapper">
    <nav class="comp-breadcrumbs">
      <a href="/">Home</a> &rsaquo;
      <span class="current">Author & Editorial Standards</span>
    </nav>

    <main class="card legal-card">
      <h1 class="legal-title">Author & Editorial Standards</h1>
      <p class="effective-date">Curated by Native Korean Cultural Researchers</p>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>About Our Editorial Team</h2>
        <p><strong>KoreanNames.info</strong> was founded by a team of native Korean linguists, cultural historians, and digital researchers based in Seoul. Our mission is to make authentic Korean naming wisdom, Sino-Korean Hanja symbolism, and phonetic harmony accessible to parents and culture enthusiasts worldwide.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2>Editorial Rigor & Verification</h2>
        <p>Every name entry in our 1,200+ database undergoes multi-step verification:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Hanja Accuracy:</strong> Cross-checked against the Supreme Court of Korea approved character list.</li>
          <li><strong>Phonetic Flow:</strong> Evaluated for natural liquid consonance and tone balance with common Korean surnames.</li>
          <li><strong>Cultural Nuance:</strong> Reviewed to ensure positive symbolic resonance without negative homophones.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-wrapper { padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .comp-breadcrumbs { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 1.25rem; display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; }
  .legal-card { padding: 3rem; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.7; }
  .legal-title { font-size: 2.2rem; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; color: var(--text-main); }
  .effective-date { font-size: 0.85rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 2rem; border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--border-color); padding-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .legal-section { margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .legal-section h2 { font-size: 1.3rem; color: var(--brand-teal-dark); margin-bottom: 0.6rem; }
  .legal-section p, .legal-section ul { color: var(--text-main); font-size: 0.95rem; }
  .legal-section ul { padding-left: 1.5rem; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
</style>
